  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/minchah_maariv/amidah/shalom" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n32.jpg">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="prayer-part" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:amidah/shalom_rav_al"/>Bestow abundance of peace upon Thy people Israel for ever for Thou art King and Lord of all peace and it is good in Thine eyes to bless Thy people Israel at all times and at every hour with Thy peace. </tei:p>
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="prayer-part" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:rosh_hashanah/text/besefer"/>In the book of life, blessing, peace and a good livelihood, may we be remembered and inscribed before Thee, we and all Thy people the house of Israel for a good life and for peace. Blessed art Thou, O Lord who makes peace. <tei:milestone unit="prayer-part"/></tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
